  14: # dictionary entries, which silently does nothing, so "worst" was whichever enumerated first. The
  15: # live reading agreed with the right answer by luck for weeks. Cases that can DISAGREE are the
  16: # whole point of this file - a test that only reproduces the situation you already have proves
